00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:55,320
 as God makes his presence known in your life,

77
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:59,680
 through your life, and to those around your life.

78
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,360
 So I'm gonna pray and then we're gonna get into it

79
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,120
 'cause I'm eager for what's ahead

80
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:06,200
 and they've already started my timer, so let me pray.

81
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,360
 God, we love you.

82
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,040
 We love you and we know God.

83
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:12,040
 Even the ability to say that is the testament

84
