 to the fact that you loved us first.

85
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:17,920
 Not a single one of us, God, is worthy of your love

86
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:21,440
 and yet you have chosen to offer it to us.

87
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:23,000
 We didn't merit it.

88
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,840
 We didn't earn it.

89
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,660
 We didn't deserve it.

90
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:26,840
 And yet, God, you nonetheless said,

91
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,480
 I love you enough to send my son.

92
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:33,080
 And Jesus, because you have come, we have come here together

93
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,120
 and we're asking that you would make yourself known,

94
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,140
 manifest among us.

95
00:03:36,140 --> 00:03:40,700
 Yes, God, we know your spirit is already here,

96
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:42,280
 that God, you are omnipresent.

97
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,400
 There is no place in all the earth

98
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:48,060
 that you are not already, always, all at once.

99
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:51,240
 And yet we're asking for something unique this weekend.

100
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,760
 We're asking for an outpouring of your spirit.

101
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:56,240
 And so God, as we lean in that direction,

102
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:59,120
 it's not just because we wanna have an awesome time together

103
